Emacsvox News -- History Of User-Visible Changes

Maintained by Emacsvox Contributors.

* Emacsvox 2026.9.4 --- Current User-Visible Changes

Released notes are preserved in [[file:NEWS-2026.9.3][NEWS for Emacsvox 2026.9.3]].

** Source archives include their installation tools

Source archives now include the maintained tools under ~utils/~. This repairs
installation and remote-launch failures caused by missing helpers in the
2026.9.3 source archive. Debian packages already included their runtime helpers.
Release preparation now installs and starts the extracted source archive in
an isolated test environment before marking the artifact ready.

** Debian packages are built after release publication

Release CI now builds the Debian package from the checked release source,
tests it in Ubuntu 26.04, and attaches the deb and checksum to the published
release. This retains the packaged Emacs 30.2 dependency and optional local
Omnivox recommendation.
